  "contentHtml": "<DIV>\r\n<DIV class=txc-textbox style=\"BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 10px; PADDING-LEFT: 10px; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199)\">\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><B><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</SPAN></SPAN></B></P></DIV>\r\n<P><BR>파동, 소리의 높낮이 부분에서 한 실험입니다.</P>\r\n<P>간단하게 수조에 고무줄을 감고, 그 길이를 달리하여 노래를 연주하게 하였습니다.</P>\r\n<P>아이들도 신기해하며 재미있어 했습니다~~~</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/264442435549FB8733\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"491\" height=\"353\" style=\"HEIGHT: 353px; WIDTH: 491px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"023Ud0151je2eubrxuxr7_vf69j3.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_264442435549FB8733EB8B\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2562E7435549FB891F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"496\" height=\"335\" style=\"HEIGHT: 335px; WIDTH: 496px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"047Ud015s9eg0ubb0lhs_vf69j3.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_2562E7435549FB891F92A6\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/267A77435549FB8A0E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"492\" height=\"373\" style=\"HEIGHT: 373px; WIDTH: 492px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"j5bUd0151rx4uy10klwae_vf69j3.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_267A77435549FB8A0EB845\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/274048435549FB8B35\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"470\" height=\"319\" style=\"HEIGHT: 319px; WIDTH: 470px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"j50Ud0151kh3ttiu6tdj2_vf69j3.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_274048435549FB8B3541DC\"/></P>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p></DIV>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
